<title>UFACTORY Global Website -</title>
<meta name="description" content="UFACTORY offers three series robot arms：UFACTORY 850, UFACTORY xArm, UFACTORY Lite 6. UFACTORY xArm series includes three models: UFACTORY xArm 5(five axes, 3 kg payload, 700 mm reach), UFACTORY xArm 6(six axes, 5kg payload, 700mm reach), UFACTORY xArm 7(seven axes, 3.5 kg payload, 700 mm reach). The key difference between UFACTORY 850 robot and UFACTORY xArm robot is repeatability, UFACTORY 850 has a ±0.02 repeatability, making it ideal for precision and stability critical applications such as welding and screw driving, etc. all of those UFACTORY robots offers competitive and transparent prices, which is the biggest advantage over similar collaborative robots on the market. Beyond price advantage, we also focus on providing reliable after-sales service, upgrading robots and software. Visit our website to know more!"/>
